.\nNote that this issue doesn't occur if godot is compiled with `dev_build=yes`\nAfter a bit of testing, I've concluded that the issue (probably) is in here:\n```cpp\n\tif (p_ws->libdecor_frame) {\n\t\tstruct libdecor_state *state = libdecor_state_new(p_width, p_height);\n\t\t// here ↓↓↓ in wayland_thread.cpp:3485\n\t\tlibdecor_frame_commit(p_ws->libdecor_frame, state, p_ws->pending_libdecor_configuration);\n\t\tlibdecor_state_free(state);\n\t\tp_ws->pending_libdecor_configuration = nullptr;\n\t}\n```\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Ensure you have the prefer wayland option enabled (either on the editor or project settings)\n2. Resize any godot window\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113919/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113919/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_c